init.description:
The list above is for adding new devices to track (only devices the router currently reports, that aren't already tracked, are shown). Below are the devices you're already tracking - in order, IP - MAC (device name, nickname):
{tracked_list}

Edit a device's nickname in the field next to it, or check its box to stop tracking it entirely (removes its entity).

nicknames.description:
Devices you just selected, in order (IP - MAC address):
{device_list}

Enter the name you want for each one. Pre-filled when the router already knows a name. Leave blank to keep using the router-reported name (or the MAC address if it has none).
